      "text": "Lima"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:7b18652d5a5304dc",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "aafb3dee62679439454d853a9fddb23b554cd726cea29db6f44e5a1b1dde738e",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261109-8e86004c97",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast at the hotel, take a sightseeing tour of Cusco with an English-speaking guide. Visit Qorikancha, Qenqo, Puka Pukara, Tambomachay and Sacsayhuamán. After the tour, transfer to the airport and fly to Lima. On arrival, transfer to the hotel."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:04d2d9b134a52e46",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f808f181e29c32128efa59a2d6be981fda09e3a4c4309d1abbcec96d792dd977",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261109-8e86004c97",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Tour Cusco with an English-speaking guide, starting at Qorikancha, the Temple of the Sun. Here the Incas held their main ritual celebration, marking the winter solstice. Then visit four nearby archaeological sites: the Temple of Qenqo, the red fortress of Puka Pukara, Tambomachay, where the Incas worshipped water, and Sacsayhuamán, a complex of religious structures, a fortress, towers and channels built from enormous stone blocks."
    },
